Quick Trips (posted via the separate quick-trip flow/table) never
appeared anywhere a user could manage them: Profile > Trips only
queried the regular trips table, and the Quick Trip detail page had
no organizer controls at all — despite a working DELETE
/api/quick-trips/:id endpoint already existing server-side.

- me.tsx: fetch /api/user/quick-trips alongside regular trips in the
  Profile Trips tab, render them with a "Quick Trip" badge, expiry
  countdown, View Details, and a Delete button (with confirm).
- quick-trip-detail.tsx: add an organizer-only Delete Trip button
  using the existing DELETE endpoint.

No PATCH/edit endpoint exists for quick trips server-side, so editing
isn't wired up yet — flagged separately if wanted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
